  {
   "t": "p",
   "html": "Out on the dry sand with the Minelab E-Terra 305, a <a href=\"@minelab-manticore/\" data-kind=\"internal\">basic metal detector</a> designed for the beginner or entry level detectorist. this is truly underated as an <a href=\"@minelab-vanquish-40-series/\" data-kind=\"internal\">entry level metal detector</a>, works really well on the dry sand and the slightly moist slope of the beach, a slow swing speed and used with no discrimination, helps to pick out targets amongst the trash, in this video i was using only 3 tones, in the previous video i used it in multl tones.."
  },
